# Tour output is regenerated on every run and never reviewed as a diff.
*.png

# reference/ is the exception: a small set of captures kept deliberately as
# evidence for a finding, named by date and what they show.
!reference/
!reference/*.png

# Reviewed, deterministic storyboards are merge evidence. Ad-hoc run folders
# remain ignored so a stale run cannot accidentally satisfy the CI contract.
!translation-split-review-storyboard/
!translation-split-review-storyboard/*.png
